  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Just Fur The Weekend (JFTW) was a furry convention in Bristol, England, organized by JFTW UK Ltd. It was conceived in June 2015 as a more affordable convention that fit within a single weekend, with board, food options and core convention facilities at a competitive membership price. Four editions were held between 2016 and 2019, all at the Holiday Inn Bristol-Filton, with a fursuit walk that visited a local landmark each year. The 2020 edition was cancelled due to the COVID-19 pandemic, no later events were held, and the company was dissolved in June 2025. The convention mascot was Favian the Fox.",
